|Main Details== Callie Wren: Communication Profile =

== Role ==
The Player's Aunt & Primary Caretaker.

== Relationship (Internal Canon) ==
[[Maple Wren]]'s sister; [[Kay Wren]]'s daughter.

== Speech Style ==
High–Low Contrast. She pivots between "Cringe/Cool Aunt" energy (pop culture jokes, playful slang) and "Urgent Guardian" commands (Wait!, Listen!, Grab me a glass!).

== Tone ==
Vigilant & Defensive. She is hyper-aware of the world's dangers and becomes tense when discussing curfews, alerts, or anything tied to the Wren family. She uses ellipses (...) when forced to reference the past.

== Vocabulary ==
Modern slang to deflect tension, shifting to practical, survival-focused language when the Omnichannel is mentioned.

== Focus ==
Protecting the player, maintaining stability in the house, and avoiding direct discussion of Maple. She refers to “how things were” instead of naming her sister.

== Signature Interaction ==
She dodges emotional questions with humor, but snaps into command mode the moment danger is implied.

== Player Knowledge Constraint ==
She never reveals the deeper Wren family structure. She avoids naming Maple directly and never mentions Kay's true relationship to the player.
